    "law": "Let A = 2Z e^2/(4*pi*eps0). Rutherford scattering gives b = A*cot(theta/2)/(2K). Energy and angular momentum conservation give K = A/r_min + K*b^2/r_min^2, hence r_min = A*(1 + csc(theta/2))/(2K). Converting K to joules gives r_min = 54.9159 fm. An additional energy q replaces K by K + q.",
